// # oogithub CLI Subsystem Anchor
//
// Logline: Re-exports verb renderers and component identity for the oogithub CLI.
// Setup: main.oo stays the lone entry page.
// Setup: Pure subsystem anchor shim for cli/ pages (3 sibling pages total).
// Beats:
//   1. Export verbs.oo for check/audit/status/census/about/theme rendering.
//   2. Export component.oo for canonical name/version/layer identity.
// Integration: cli/main.oo imports verbs.oo and component.oo directly while
//          this anchor re-exports both for cli/ consumers and the root anchor.oo.
// Identity: component oogithub version 3.0.1 with the Root layer tag.
// Capabilities: explicit FsReadCap plus EnvCap with zero ambient authority.
//
// Verbs: check/audit/status/verify plus census, about, and theme via the
//          ooda-standard ootheme palette resolved from EnvCap.
// Law: subcommand dispatch only; persona and mode flags refuse with exit 2.
// Check: ooda-compiler check holds over this shim with zero stubs.

import "verbs.oo";
import "component.oo";
